DOMAIN-SUFFIX, rayjump.com, REJECT
DOMAIN-SUFFIX, mobvista.com, REJECT
DOMAIN-SUFFIX, anythinktech.com, REJECT
DOMAIN-SUFFIX, sigmob.cn, REJECT
DOMAIN-SUFFIX, beizi.biz, REJECT

# 微博 / 知乎 / 小红书 / 网易云广告
DOMAIN, sdkapp.uve.weibo.com, REJECT
DOMAIN-SUFFIX, ad.weibo.com, REJECT
DOMAIN, appcloud2.in.zhihu.com, REJECT
DOMAIN, sugar.zhihu.com, REJECT
DOMAIN, ads-img-qc.xhscdn.com, REJECT
DOMAIN, ads-video-qc.xhscdn.com, REJECT
